Hello all,

Today we published s390-tools-2.0.0 on github under the MIT license:

 - https://github.com/ibm-s390-tools/s390-tools

This version is functionally equivalent to the s390-tools release 1.39.0
on developerWorks:

 - https://www.ibm.com/developerworks/linux/linux390/s390-tools-1.39.0.html

Future s390-tools development will be reflected on github only.
IBM developerWorks stays as it is.

We are pleased to announce that from now on we can also accept contributions
from outside IBM:

 - https://github.com/ibm-s390-tools/s390-tools/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md

Best Regards,
